    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "option": {},
      "args": {
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "text": "悪しき伝承によってのみ知る『鬼神』に、\n少年と少女の技が叩き込まれる。",
        "autominsec": 1,
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0049_TXT2029"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "option": {},
      "args": {
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "text": "だが数十、数百の拳打を浴びた鬼神は\n身じろぎもしない。",
        "autominsec": 1,
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0049_TXT2030"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "BgZoom",
      "option": {
        "async": 1
      },
      "args": {
        "duration": 10,
        "zoom": 1.3,
        "curve": "{\"k\":[\"{\\\"p\\\":[0.0,0.0,3.4224936962127687,3.4224936962127687,0.0,0.0934959277510643],\\\"m\\\":0}\",\"{\\\"p\\\":[1.004058837890625,1.0062980651855469,0.01924935169517994,0.01924935169517994,0.2398374080657959,0.0],\\\"m\\\":0}\"]}"
      }
    },
    {
      "command": "Text",
      "option": {},
      "args": {
        "type": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "text": "鬼神は技で応じるまでもなく、\n強靭な肉体のみで\nそれらをすべて受けきって見せたのである。",
        "autominsec": 1,
        "textId": "IDS_SCENARIOGATE0049_TXT2031"
      }
    },
    {
